        "gg_SAPNrPPR_text": "<p>A June 2025 report found that 8 out of 10 top-selling creatine gummy brands on Amazon failed potency and purity tests</p>",
        "ggo53rzHYTb_text": "<p>A June 2025 report found that 8 out of 10 top-selling creatine gummy brands on Amazon failed potency and purity tests</p>",
        "ggvNQZzpjJn_text": "The Underdosing Epidemic: 67% of Gummies Have Virtually No Creatine"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-608994783087559254"
    },
