        "ggN_k58AoOJ_text": "<p>Most people notice better workouts and mental clarity in 7–14 days. Full strength and recovery benefits hit around week 3–4. That’s exactly why we recommend the 2-pouch Performance Pack — it gives you a full 60-day trial so you can feel the difference risk-free.</p>",
