        "ggdlVikeEBF_text": "<p>Every single batch is tested by an ISO 17025 accredited lab after cooking. We publish the full COA. No other gummy brand shows you post-cooking results. That’s why 8 of the top 10 Amazon brands failed independent tests — we refused to play that game</p>",
        "ggeyqXU0Tmk_text": "Frequently Asked <span style=\"color:#3A5A40;\"><i>Questions</i></span>",
        "ggn3nXnbjB__text": "<p>Then we don’t want your money. Use the entire pouch (or even empty it) and email us within 90 days. We’ll refund every penny — no questions, no restocking fees, and we even cover return shipping. Over 12,847 customers have trusted this promise</p>"
